            "block_content": "2-6.5. In the event a grievance is brought up for consideration at the end of a school year, and if the principal (or immediate superior or department head, if applicable) is not available after the closing of school for procedures outlined in Step II, the employee may proceed directly to Step III, if the JCEA Grievance Evaluation Team contends that there is merit to the matter.",
