        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2-6.6. If the grievant is not satisfied with the disposition of the grievance at Step IV, the grievant shall have the right to request arbitration pursuant to the rules and regulations established by the American Arbitration Association. A request for arbitration shall be made not later than fifteen (15) school days after the disposition of the grievance at Step IV.",
            "block_bbox": [
